# Copy to .env and put your own key in it. .env is gitignored — never commit a real key.
#
# Get one at https://console.cloud.google.com/apis/credentials
# with the "YouTube Data API v3" enabled for the project.
#
# The key is read in the Electron main process only. It is never sent to the
# renderer and never appears in any client-side JavaScript.
#
# Without a key the app still runs: it falls back to the local clips in
# ~/Library/Application Support/FocusReels/media and shows a "Demo mode" badge.
YOUTUBE_API_KEY=
